# Real operational config & deploy units — NEVER commit. They expose chat IDs, auto-pay
# thresholds, server paths/IPs and secret-file locations. Use the *.example templates and
# provide real values only on the deployment host (env vars / EnvironmentFile / res dir).
bridge_config.json
pezbridge_bot_config.json
deploy/*.service
!deploy/*.service.example
# Runtime data & any secret material that must never reach a repo
bridge_db.json
bridge_seed.json
*_seed.json
*.env
